{'symbol': 'STE', 'date': '2021-11-02 16:30:00', 'title': 'STERIS ANNOUNCES FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR FISCAL 2022 SECOND QUARTER', 'text': 'DUBLIN, IRELAND , NOV. 02, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- STERIS PLC (NYSE: STE) (“STERIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS FISCAL 2022 SECOND QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2021. REVENUE AS REPORTED FOR THE QUARTER INCREASED 58% TO $1,197 MILLION COMPARED WITH $756 MILLION IN THE SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL 2021. CONSTANT CURRENCY ORGANIC REVENUE (SEE NON-GAAP FINANCIAL MEASURES) INCREASED 12% FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL 2022 AS COMPARED TO THE SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL 2021.'}